    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d411">

                <pb facs="0533" n="465" sameAs="frus:frus1914-20v01/pg465"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">462.11 Se 8/39</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        President Wilson
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-08-07">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 7, 1915</hi>.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. President</hi>: I enclose, for your
                    consideration, a draft of reply<anchor n="40" xml:id="d411-f1"/> to the German
                    note on the <hi rendition="#italic">Frye</hi> case,<anchor n="41"
                        xml:id="d411-f2"/> which has been prepared by Mr. Chandler P. Anderson. He
                    also submitted with the draft a memorandum on the case which explains certain
                    features of the draft.</p>
                <p>It seems to me that the proposed reply is excellent and takes a very consistent
                    attitude on the questions in dispute. It furthermore introduces the principle of
                    arbitration which, if once adopted, may be extended to other subjects of
                    difference.</p>
                <p>I am also enclosing a printed copy of the German note on the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Frye</hi> case.</p>
                <p>Faithfully yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d411-a1.xml" xpointer="d411-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
